<title>USA: DLJ's Sprout Group names 10th Gen'l Partner.</title>
<headline>DLJ's Sprout Group names 10th Gen'l Partner.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Sprout Group, the venture capital affiliate of Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette, said Monday it has named Philippe Chambon as the group's 10th General Partner.</p>
<p>Chambon joined Sprout's life sciences group, located in Menlo Park, Calif., in 1995 focusing on new investment opportunities in the areas of biotherapeutics, medical devices, human diagnostics and medical infomatics.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
